# Build context hygiene: dependencies are installed inside the image, build output is rebuilt there,
# and no local secret file may ever enter the context (and thereby a layer or the build cache).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
.git
.pnpm-store

# Secrets and local environment files (the container receives them via compose `env_file`, never via COPY)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
